---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="sbp10costladder">
  <div class="sbp10costladder-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 206" role="img" aria-label="Bar chart of trading cost: 0.4% for one round trip a year, 1.6% for four and 4.8% for twelve, on a fully invested portfolio at a 0.15% commission.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Every buy and sell pays 0.15% each plus 0.1% tax on the sale: 0.4% per round trip</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi lệnh mua và bán trả 0,15% cùng thuế 0,1% khi bán: 0,4% mỗi vòng mua rồi bán</tspan></text>
      <text x="230" y="79" class="b" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>1 round trip a year</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1 vòng mua bán mỗi năm</tspan></text>
      <rect x="240" y="58" width="32.0" height="30" class="bar-green" />
      <text x="282.0" y="79" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>0.4% = 400,000 VND on 100,000,000</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>0,4% = 400.000 đồng trên 100.000.000</tspan></text>
      <text x="230" y="125" class="b" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>4 round trips a year</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>4 vòng mua bán mỗi năm</tspan></text>
      <rect x="240" y="104" width="128.0" height="30" class="bar-gold" />
      <text x="378.0" y="125" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>1.6% = 1,600,000 VND on 100,000,000</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1,6% = 1.600.000 đồng trên 100.000.000</tspan></text>
      <text x="230" y="171" class="b" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>12 round trips a year</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>12 vòng mua bán mỗi năm</tspan></text>
      <rect x="240" y="150" width="384.0" height="30" class="bar-red" />
      <text x="634.0" y="171" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>4.8% = 4,800,000 VND on 100,000,000</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>4,8% = 4.800.000 đồng trên 100.000.000</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Cost = round trips x (0.15% + 0.15% + 0.1%), if the whole portfolio is turned each time. Your broker may charge a different commission.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Chi phí = số vòng x (0,15% + 0,15% + 0,1%), nếu mỗi lần xoay cả danh mục. Công ty chứng khoán của bạn có thể tính phí khác.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
   .sbp10costladder { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp10costladder-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
   .sbp10costladder svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
   .sbp10costladder text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
   .sbp10costladder .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10costladder .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10costladder .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10costladder .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
   .sbp10costladder .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10costladder .green { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10costladder .gold { fill: var(--act-1); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10costladder .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
   .sbp10costladder .card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10costladder .card-green { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10costladder .card-gold { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10costladder .ln { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10costladder .axis { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10costladder .dash { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
   .sbp10costladder .arw { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
   .sbp10costladder .arw-h { fill: var(--text-muted); }
   .sbp10costladder .bar-red { fill: var(--red); }
   .sbp10costladder .bar-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
   .sbp10costladder .bar-gold { fill: var(--gold); }
   .sbp10costladder .bar-mut { fill: var(--text-faint); }
   .sbp10costladder .path-line { fill: none; stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10costladder .path-red { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10costladder .dot { fill: var(--act-2); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10costladder .dot-red { fill: var(--red); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10costladder figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
